WEBVTT

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.495
Budapest.

00:00:48.552 --> 00:00:50.564
The next stop's Budapest.

00:00:50.971 --> 00:00:52.806
Budapest is the next stop.

00:00:52.973 --> 00:00:54.028
Budapest.

00:00:55.095 --> 00:00:56.268
Tickets, ladies.

00:00:56.632 --> 00:00:57.643
Here you go.

00:00:57.686 --> 00:00:59.563
-Here's mine.
-And mine.

00:00:59.646 --> 00:01:01.690
-Mine, too!
-Here you go!

00:01:04.109 --> 00:01:06.236
Thank you, young man.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.072
Man, I hate wearing disguises.

00:01:09.396 --> 00:01:11.033
These heels are killing me.

00:01:11.617 --> 00:01:13.118
Okay, take it down a notch.

00:01:13.145 --> 00:01:14.561
We don't want to alarm the humans.

00:01:15.888 --> 00:01:16.974
Drac.

00:01:18.462 --> 00:01:20.626
I'm about to und freak out!

00:01:21.196 --> 00:01:22.544
You're a nice kitty.

00:01:23.629 --> 00:01:25.090
I'm und kitty-cat.

00:01:34.097 --> 00:01:36.308
No, not this clown again.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:38.894
Good evening, travelers.

00:01:38.977 --> 00:01:42.314
I am Professor Abraham Van Helsing.

00:01:42.439 --> 00:01:45.442
Yes. One of the Van Helsings.

00:01:45.526 --> 00:01:48.987
For centuries, my family
has protected humanity

00:01:49.024 --> 00:01:51.406
from the evils of monsters.

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:56.578
So you can believe me when I tell you,
there are monsters hiding amongst you!

00:01:58.247 --> 00:01:59.308
But fear not,

00:01:59.731 --> 00:02:03.418
for I am a professional,
and I know how to flush out

00:02:03.502 --> 00:02:06.922
these beasts
and bring them into the light!

00:02:07.881 --> 00:02:08.966
Fire bad!

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:43.001
Sorry, guys.

00:02:54.386 --> 00:02:57.080
Finally! First I kill Dracula,

00:02:57.097 --> 00:03:00.152
and then the rest of the monsters!

00:03:00.175 --> 00:03:01.810
Why do you keep doing this?

00:03:01.894 --> 00:03:04.813
Your dad, your grandfather,
your great-great-granny...

00:03:04.897 --> 00:03:06.481
I defeated them all.

00:03:06.565 --> 00:03:10.152
When will you Van Helsings ever
learn to let go of the hate?

00:03:10.235 --> 00:03:13.322
Never! Because you, monster, are a...

00:03:16.036 --> 00:03:17.504
What? A mouse?

00:03:19.828 --> 00:03:22.998
You can't run from me,
Prince of Darkness!

00:03:23.165 --> 00:03:25.959
I will hunt you for all eternity!

00:03:28.128 --> 00:03:32.299
I swear I will never rest
until I destroy you...

00:03:32.633 --> 00:03:33.634
And...

00:03:33.717 --> 00:03:34.927
Every...

00:03:35.052 --> 00:03:36.094
Other...

00:03:36.178 --> 00:03:37.304
Monster...

00:03:37.387 --> 00:03:38.889
If it's the last thing...

00:03:39.181 --> 00:03:40.182
I...

00:03:40.307 --> 00:03:41.308
Ever...

00:03:41.475 --> 00:03:42.851
Do!

00:03:46.647 --> 00:03:48.690
Boy, that guy is annoying.

00:03:48.857 --> 00:03:50.971
Maybe one day there will be a place

00:03:50.984 --> 00:03:53.608
where monsters can go
to get away from it all,

00:03:53.982 --> 00:03:55.155
take a vacation.

00:03:55.238 --> 00:03:57.563
Who knows, maybe even get married.

00:03:57.768 --> 00:03:59.051
Wouldn't that be something?

00:04:44.231 --> 00:04:45.312
It's okay.

00:04:46.123 --> 00:04:47.833
When is this thing starting?

00:04:48.834 --> 00:04:50.419
You made them cry, Wayne.

00:04:50.794 --> 00:04:52.629
All except this little one.

00:04:53.296 --> 00:04:55.048
That's Sunny. She doesn't cry.

00:04:56.341 --> 00:04:57.426
She bites.

00:04:58.635 --> 00:05:00.971
This is a very special moment, Carl.

00:05:01.138 --> 00:05:06.393
Any second, your beautiful bride
is going to walk right down the aisle.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.313
Oh no, Drac, she's not coming.

00:05:10.772 --> 00:05:11.773
Don't worry.

00:05:11.857 --> 00:05:15.902
Mavis is with her.
I'm sure everything is under control.

00:05:16.778 --> 00:05:18.697
Mavey, is everything under control?

00:05:19.448 --> 00:05:21.992
Yep, just a slight case
of pre-wedding jitters.

00:05:32.961 --> 00:05:34.588
Yep, everything is fine here.

00:05:36.131 --> 00:05:37.841
Please try to relax, Lucy.

00:05:37.924 --> 00:05:39.634
I've taken care of everything.

00:05:40.177 --> 00:05:42.345
The wedding is going to be perfect.

00:05:42.804 --> 00:05:44.014
It's not that.

00:05:44.097 --> 00:05:46.933
Just, how do I know
I'm doing the right thing?

00:05:50.395 --> 00:05:51.980
I know just how you feel.

00:05:52.147 --> 00:05:55.442
The day I married Johnny was
the best day of my life, but

00:05:55.609 --> 00:05:56.985
I was so nervous.

00:05:57.152 --> 00:05:58.862
Not as nervous as I was.

00:05:59.029 --> 00:06:01.615
And you should have seen my dad.
He was a mess.

00:06:01.782 --> 00:06:04.409
I wouldn't get out
of my coffin that night.

00:06:04.576 --> 00:06:06.411
But he knew it was meant to be.

00:06:06.578 --> 00:06:10.373
It doesn't matter where you come from
or how different you are.

00:06:10.457 --> 00:06:14.461
A Zing only happens once in your life,
and you have to cherish it.

00:06:19.049 --> 00:06:20.872
You're right! Thank you!

00:06:21.843 --> 00:06:23.202
Okay. All right. Okay.

00:06:23.986 --> 00:06:24.997
Okay.

00:06:28.433 --> 00:06:29.643
I do.

00:06:32.145 --> 00:06:33.230
I do.

00:06:39.069 --> 00:06:40.070
Do you hear that?

00:06:40.153 --> 00:06:42.864
- Yes. I thought we locked him in his
room. - We did!

00:06:45.242 --> 00:06:47.548
- Hi, Mom. Hi, Papa.
-Dennis! -Dennis!

00:06:47.702 --> 00:06:49.830
Tinkles was crying, so we let him out.

